      "heading_level": null,
      "md_text": "As you will notice, the A500 and 2000 deletes clocks and interrupt lines from the A1000. The +/−5Vdc and reset lines are also deleted. The +/−12Vdc lines are identical to a PC10/20.",
      "bbox": [
